B.bDC=s(["Start by kneeling on the ground with your knees hip-width apart.",u.op,"Slowly lean forward, shifting your weight onto your hands and extending your legs behind you.","Keep your back straight and engage your glutes as you push your hips back and up towards the ceiling.","Hold this position for a few seconds, feeling a stretch in your glutes.","Slowly return to the starting position by bending your knees and lowering your hips back down.",u.t],t.s)
