B.bDF=s(["Sit on a flat bench with your feet flat on the ground and your knees bent.","Hold a barbell with both hands in front of your chest, keeping your elbows slightly bent.","Engage your core and slowly twist your torso to one side, keeping your back straight.","Pause for a moment at the end of the twist, then slowly rotate back to the starting position.","Repeat the twist to the other side.",u.j],t.s)
