B.bJz=s([u.Rw,"Slowly roll the ball forward, walking your feet out until your upper back is resting on the ball and your legs are extended straight in front of you.","Place your hands on your hips for support.","Engage your core and slowly lower your upper body towards the ground, keeping your back straight and your chest lifted.","Stop when you feel a stretch in your hamstrings, and hold the position for 20-30 seconds.","Slowly return to the starting position by pushing through your heels and using your hamstrings to pull yourself back up.",u.t],t.s)
