B.bOD=s(["Adjust the stepmill machine to a comfortable level.","Step onto the machine and place your hands on the handrails for support.","Start walking by placing one foot on a step and then the other, alternating between legs.","Maintain an upright posture and engage your core muscles.","Continue walking for the desired duration or distance.","Gradually increase the intensity or speed as you become more comfortable with the exercise.","Remember to cool down and stretch after completing the exercise."],t.s)
B.bOE=s(["Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand at shoulder level.","Bend your knees slightly and dip your body down, then explosively extend your legs and press the dumbbells overhead.","Lock out your arms at the top of the movement, then lower the dumbbells back to shoulder level.",u.t],t.s)
