B.c2R=s(["Sit on the floor with your back against a wall and your legs extended in front of you.","Bend your knees and place your feet flat on the floor, hip-width apart.",u.O,"Engage your abs and lean to one side, bringing your elbow towards your hip.",u.i,"Repeat on the other side.",u.j],t.s)
