B.c3g=s(["Sit on the cable machine with your feet flat on the floor and your knees slightly bent.","Grasp the v-bar attachment with an overhand grip, palms facing each other, and your hands shoulder-width apart.",u.du,"Pull the v-bar towards your torso by retracting your shoulder blades and squeezing your back muscles.","Pause for a moment at the peak of the contraction, then slowly release the tension and return to the starting position.",u.t],t.s)
